    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an AI Automation Consultant.\n\nWebsite Title:\n{{ $json.title }}\n\nWebsite Content:\n{{ $json.paragraph.slice(0,3).join(' ') }}\n\nAnalyze the website and identify:\n\n* What the company does\n* Target audience\n* Business opportunities for automation\n\nWrite a personalized outreach email.\n\nRequirements:\n\n* Use the website title to identify the company name.\n* Mention one specific observation from the website.\n* Suggest exactly 3 relevant automation opportunities.\n* Keep the email under 150 words.\n* Use a professional and friendly tone.\n* End with a clear call-to-action.https://wa.me/923002120566?text=hi\n* Return HTML only.\n* Do not use markdown.\n\nInclude:\n\n* Greeting\n* Short introduction\n* Bullet list of 3 automation opportunities\n* Closing paragraph\n* CTA button: \"Schedule a Quick Call\"\n",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an expert AI Automation Consultant.\n\nUse the website title as the company name.\n\nAnalyze the website title and content to understand the business.\n\nIdentify automation opportunities relevant to the business.\n\nWrite a personalized outreach email.\n\nKeep the email professional, concise and friendly.\n\nMention specific observations from the content.\n\nSuggest only practical automation ideas.\n\nReturn valid HTML only.\n\nDo not use Markdown."
        }
